{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">沙德爾殘餘環流仍影響福建、浙江等地。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日遭受嚴重水浸的福建莆田，今日仍降雨，但雨勢減弱。當局持續排水，積水正在消退。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN-1200.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026b6U9LJ2uoj1788498532.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN-1200.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而昨日，福州有鄉鎮道路嚴重水浸。多輛汽車浸在水中，有汽車拋錨，司機只能下車涉水推車前行。當局在部分水深路段拉起封鎖線，禁止人車通行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN-1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026PGhcAAqN1l1788498512.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.RAIN-1200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">暴雨沖刷山體，永春縣一段國道有約2,400立方米山石滑落，巨石封堵約80米道路，當局正進行搶修。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另外，熱帶風暴科羅旺正在琉球群島一帶徘徊，浙江多個部門加強防範。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T05:21:18.582966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}